OL,3,GNEWSACare workers ready to strike in
OL,4,Aequal pay dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of care workers have voted for
OL,7,Fstrike action in a dispute over equal
OL,8,Fpay.
OL,10,FMore than 300 staff employed at
OL,11,FSunderland Council's local authority
OL,12,Ftrading company, Sunderland Care and
OL,13,FSupport, have voted in favour of
OL,14,Findustrial action in an indicative
OL,15,Fballot. A full ballot will be held in
OL,16,Fthe coming days.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
