OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACare workers ready to strike in
OL,4,Aequal pay dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe GMB union claims that the
OL,7,Fpredominately female workers have been
OL,8,Fdenied access to a more generous local
OL,9,Fauthority pension scheme, that is
OL,10,Fpredominantly open to male council
OL,11,Fworkers.
OL,13,FThey are also paid less per hour than
OL,14,Ftheir male colleagues, the GMB says.
OL,15,FThe council said it was continuing to
OL,16,Fengage in discussions with the union.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
